  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 350°F and line a baking sheet with parchment.",
    "Cream the butter, brown sugar and granulated sugar on low for 2 min.",
    "Add the egg, banana and vanilla and mix on low 2 min more.",
    "Add the flour, baking soda, baking powder and salt and fold until just combined.",
    "Fold in the chocolate chips.",
    "Scoop 2 tbsp mounds 2 in apart on the sheet.",
    "Bake 10-12 min, until the edges are lightly golden and the tops look set. The centers stay soft.",
    "Cool 5 min on the sheet, then move to a rack."
  ],
